5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's not repeat old mistakes. I'll start by looking at the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical start. I am interested in the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to understand where the delays actually happen. I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the hidden surprises in our old structures. I will look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates to see the long-term financial commitments.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
